      "title": {
        "en": "Engaged leadership and caring staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents overwhelmingly praise owner April, manager Sarah, and the front-line caregivers for treating visiting dogs like family. Longtime clients highlight that staff remember pets by name and manage complex medical regimens diligently, although one reviewer raised concerns regarding employee professionalism and inconsistent care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 14,
      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated care for energetic dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Owners report that their dogs eagerly anticipate visits and return home settled, cheerful, and pleasantly tired after daycare or boarding stays. Reviewers appreciate that caregivers accommodate both high-energy puppies needing safe play spaces and senior or paralyzed dogs requiring specialized handling, medication schedules, and extra attention."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 5,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clean facility and comfortable suites"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently commend the cleanliness and central Dallas location of the facility, noting that play areas and boarding suites are well maintained and tidy. Owners appreciate the selection of accommodation options, including comfortable tuck-in services and dedicated play spaces that keep dogs active throughout their stay."
      }
    }
